OL,3,GNEWSAThames tunnel plan to heat 650,000
OL,4,Ahomes gets #41m
OL,5,
OL,6,FA heat network that will run under and
OL,7,Falongside the River Thames, using
OL,8,Frecycled heat to warm 650,000 homes in
OL,9,FLondon, has been awarded #41m in
OL,10,Fgovernment funding.
OL,12,FThe London Strategic Heat Main will use
OL,13,Fexcess heat from sources like data
OL,14,Fcentres or factories, and transport it
OL,15,Fvia a system of hot water pipes.
OL,17,FThe initial phase will cross seven
OL,18,Fboroughs from Bexley in south London,
OL,19,Fthrough Greenwich, Lewisham, Southwark,
OL,20,FCity of London, Lambeth, and
OL,21,FWestminster.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
